{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "purpose": "Production inventory for 53 main species and the player. Each entry records its current design and review state; availability in the development preview is distinct from final technical conformance.",
  "catalogSource": {
    "path": "tools/data/engine.json",
    "selector": "mob.species",
    "fields": [
      "id",
      "name"
    ]
  },
  "promptSource": "art-reference/monsters/animation-prompt-template.md",
  "arena": {
    "url": "http://localhost:5173/__showcase?sample=arpg-arena#showcase-field",
    "viewport": {
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 1080
    },
    "cameraSource": "game/src/ui/combat/combat-arena-view.ts"
  },
  "productionContract": {
    "status": "batch-production",
    "nativeCellSize": 384,
    "runtimeSupplementalSpecies": [
      "wolf",
      "spider",
      "wisp"
    ],
    "directions": {
      "idle": [
        "south",
        "south-east",
        "east",
        "north-east",
        "north",
        "north-west",
        "west",
        "south-west"
      ],
      "walk": [
        "east",
        "west"
      ],
      "attack": [
        "east",
        "west"
      ],
      "hit": [
        "east",
        "west"
      ],
      "death": [
        "east",
        "west"
      ]
    },
    "frameCounts": {
      "idle": 1,
      "walk": 4,
      "attack": 4,
      "hit": 4,
      "death": 4
    },
    "pivot": {
      "x": 192,
      "y": 288
    },
    "layout": {
      "columns": 8,
      "rows": 5,
      "runtimeFrameCanvas": {
        "width": 384,
        "height": 384
      },
      "referenceSourceCanvas": {
        "width": 1585,
        "height": 992
      },
      "frameOrder": [
        "idle S SE E NE N NW W SW",
        "east walk4, west walk4",
        "east attack4, west attack4",
        "east hit4, west hit4",
        "east death4, west death4"
      ]
    },
    "animationStates": [
      "idle",
      "locomotion",
      "attack",
      "hit",
      "death"
    ],
    "workflow": "one-species-at-a-time"
  },
  "productionAnimationBatch": {
    "status": "visual-approved",
    "atlasPathPattern": "art-reference/monsters/<species>/animation/atlas/animation.png",
    "metadataPathPattern": "art-reference/monsters/<species>/animation/meta.json",
    "species": [
      "goblin",
      "orc",
      "kobold",
      "ogre",
      "troll",
      "minotaur",
      "skeleton",
      "mummy",
      "vampire",
      "demon",
      "slime",
      "golem",
      "dragon",
      "treant",
      "human",
      "lizardman",
      "elf",
      "giant",
      "werewolf",
      "dryad"
    ],
    "notes": [
      "These 20 baseline atlases are approved for the live ARPG battlefield; each meta.json records the actual source PNG size and frame bounds.",
      "Production copies live under game/public/combat/arpg/pixel-v2; the untouched image-generation originals remain in Codex's generated-images folder."
    ]
  },
  "variantAnimationBatch": {
    "status": "draft-review",
    "source": "tools/data/engine.json#mob.variants",
    "speciesCount": 36,
    "variantCount": 156,
    "completedVariantCount": 156,
    "atlasPathPattern": "art-reference/monsters/<species>/variants/<variant-id>/atlas/animation-draft.png",
    "metadataPathPattern": "art-reference/monsters/<species>/variants/<variant-id>/meta.json",
    "frameContract": {
      "columns": 8,
      "rows": 5,
      "frameCanvas": {
        "width": 384,
        "height": 384
      },
      "totalFrames": 40,
      "directionsPerState": [
        "south",
        "south-east",
        "east",
        "north-east",
        "north",
        "north-west",
        "west",
        "south-west"
      ],
      "framesPerStateDirection": 1,
      "states": [
        "idle",
        "walk",
        "attack",
        "hit",
        "death"
      ]
    },
    "notes": [
      "Create one separate atlas for every named gameplay variant; the 32 action poses cover walk, attack, hit and death in all eight directions.",
      "These are review candidates. Runtime art registration and production approval remain separate work.",
      "Atlas pose ownership is recovered from the original generated alpha; complete sprites use padded 384 x 384 cells with a shared ground anchor."
    ]
  },
  "integrationGap": {
    "artDefinitionSource": "game/src/ui/combat/arena/arena-art.ts",
    "sceneSource": "game/src/ui/combat/CombatArenaScene.svelte",
    "currentRuntimeAnimationStates": [
      "idle",
      "walk",
      "attack",
      "hit",
      "death"
    ],
    "notes": [
      "Battlefield Style is a client setting: ARPG uses CombatArenaScene and Pixel-v2 species atlases; Classic uses the existing FieldPlates battlefield.",
      "The development sprite selector uses the production registry for the 20 canonical Mob atlases and keeps named reference variants available for comparison.",
      "Wolf, Spider and Wisp are supplemental runtime atlases and use the same 384 x 384 runtime cell contract.",
      "ARPG combat records its arena presentation timeline during live ticks; the preview keeps the normal three-mob encounter.",
      "Hit/death, packed source frames, fixed ground/core anchors and pixel sampling are supported.",
      "Idle has eight facings; action animations currently cover east/west.",
      "Approved baseline atlases ship from game/public/combat/arpg/pixel-v2; review-only variants remain development-only.",
      "Explicit sprite previews select a body size supported by the canonical species; the normal arena retains its original small goblins."
    ]
  },
  "notes": [
    "Only species identifiers and names are sourced from the canonical gameplay catalog; gameplay tuning, race and damage flags are intentionally not art requirements.",
    "Body plans and equipment are recorded only where the existing image was visually inspected. Null means pending design or visual review.",
    "Static poses do not establish an animation gait. Locomotion remains null until its animation design is confirmed.",
    "An empty equipment array means no separate equipment was visible in the inspected reference; it is not a restriction on the approved design.",
    "Assets retain their individual pending-design, draft-review or visual-approved status. Generated sources require review before being treated as game-ready assets."
  ],
